# Written by scripts/generate-credentials.sh from the Google console download. Never committed:
# a release build and a developer build point at different projects, and this repo stays publishable.
#
# By name rather than by path, and that is the point: this was an anchored path until the FacetCore
# split moved the file, and the moment it moved the old location stopped being ignored with a real
# client_secret still sitting in it. A pattern that cannot be outrun by moving the file is the one
# worth having for a secret.
google-client.json

# Built by scripts/package.sh: a disk image to send somebody, not something to commit.
/dist/

# Swift compiler intermediates, if a build ever writes them into the working directory again.
# Twelve of these were committed in `db58b96` and removed on 2026-09-16; a clean `rm -rf .build &&
# swift build` does not reproduce them, so nothing in the build wants them there now. The rule is
# here so that whatever produced them once cannot commit them a second time unnoticed.
/*.d
/*.dia
/*.swiftdeps
/*.swiftmodule
